{
 "encounter_id": "00578",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Hello. Just checking, you're Imani Okafor, born in 2008? Is that right?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yeah, that's me. Um, hi."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Nice to meet you, Imani. I've read your GP's letter, but I'd like to hear it from you. What's been happening?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's my knee. The right one. It's gone all swollen and, um... it just won't go down."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Swollen right knee. How long has it been like that?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "About three weeks? Maybe a bit more. I noticed it after games, then it just stayed."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "After games, so you play sport?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Football. For school, and a Sunday team. Well, I did. I haven't, since it got bad."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Does it hurt, or is it mainly the swelling?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It aches. Sort of a dull... it's worse when I go down the stairs."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "So a dull ache that's worse on the stairs. Anything in the mornings?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's really stiff when I wake up. Takes ages, like an hour, before I can bend it properly."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "An hour of stiffness. Does it ease as the day goes on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yeah, mostly. Then by evening it's sort of... tight again."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right. Have you noticed yourself limping?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A bit. My mum says I walk funny. I didn't really... I hadn't noticed."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's helpful, thank you. Any particular injury before it started? A fall, a twist?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that. I've been thinking about it and, no."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Any fevers, or feeling hot and shivery?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fever. Just tired. Really tired, actually, which I thought was revision."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Tired, yes, I'll note that. Have you had any redness or pain in your eyes?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, my eyes are fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And any tummy trouble? Loose stools, belly pain, blood?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing there. It's all normal."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thanks. What medicines do you take?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ibuprofen, 400 mg, when the knee's bad. Mum gave me it. And, um... the cetirizine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The cetirizine, what's that for, and what dose?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "For my hay fever. 10 mg, once a day, in the spring and summer."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Alright. And how often is the ibuprofen?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Most days now. Two, maybe, trailing off... it takes the edge off."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Do you have any allergies, to medicines or food?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Peanuts. My lips went puffy and itchy once, so now I just avoid them."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Peanuts, with puffy, itchy lips. I'll put that on your record. What else is in your medical history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Eczema, since I was little. And acne, which is annoying. Um... and I get migraines."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Eczema, acne and migraines, plus the hay fever. Have you had any operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Tonsils out when I was six. And my appendix, two years ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Does anyone in the family have joint or skin conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My dad's got psoriasis. On his elbows, mostly. I don't think it's... I don't know if that's connected."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It might well be useful to know, so thank you. Tell me about your day-to-day. School?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm in Year 12. Doing sciences. I'm trying to keep up but the knee gets in the way."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And who do you live with, and what do you eat?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Mum and my little brother. And I'm vegetarian, have been since last year."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Great. Hop up on the couch, and I'll look at that knee.",
   "pause": 12
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your right knee is swollen and warm compared with the left. It bends only part of the way, and it's tender along the inner side.",
   "pause": 8
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Now your numbers. Blood pressure is 112 over 68, and pulse is 78.",
   "pause": 10
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Temperature is 37.4 degrees, oxygen is 99 percent, and weight is 62 kilograms."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that all fine? I'm sorry, I always worry about the... yeah."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "No need to apologise. The numbers are fine, apart from the slightly warm temperature."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So what is it? Is it something really bad?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me explain. This looks most like an inflammatory arthritis, where the lining of the joint gets irritated."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Arthritis? Like old people have?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Young people get it too. I can't rule out an infection in the joint yet, which is why we test."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "An infection? That sounds scary."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's less likely, given the lack of fever. But we check, to be safe."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. What tests?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to order blood tests for inflammation, an ultrasound scan of the knee, and an X-ray as well."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The ultrasound is painless. And I'll arrange an eye check with our eye clinic, because this type of arthritis can quietly affect the eyes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in two weeks with the results, and we'll decide treatment then."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. Can I keep taking the ibuprofen until then?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes, take it with food, and no more than you have been. We'll talk about the football after the tests."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thank you. Sorry for not saying much."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "You've told me everything I needed, Imani. Take care, and say hello to your mum."
  }
 ],
